      "Pearson, R. (n.d.a). *How do you build self-esteem that lasts? The Self-Esteem Triad*. Available at: [https://www.remipearson.com/ideas-models/self-esteem-triad](/ideas-models/self-esteem-triad) (Accessed: 5 October 2026).",
